    "sourceGaps": [
      "The native Appendix1 refers to a figure, but this source prints no obtained Thiele apparatus drawing. Appendix2 preserves empty β-d-fructose and α-lactose data cells, all printed table labels/values and the decomposition note. Appendix4 prints “125 g resorcinol” literally. The key's “Aldehydic group” description of fructose, source equation charges/coefficients and extra O glyph in its pentose/furfural drawing are preserved. The two target substances and all four source appendices belong to one connected practical assignment. No missing forms, numerical laboratory results, reagents, drawings or revised chemistry are invented. All procedure text is attributed historical compilation wording.",
      "Historical original single-pass checkpoint80f51f...af29 covers actual physical210–217, printed207–214. Seven already personally opened final native300dpi crops are bound to crop plan9d78c7...455; zero fresh original-page credit. This is editable working Markdown only, not a candidate, receipt or publication. Volume 1 archive/compiler teaching source, Anton Sirota / IChO International Information Centre, ©2008 IUVENTA, Not for sale; native common rights/editorial recreation qualifications apply.",
      "The printed key refers to “the list at the end” for a), but no bottle-number list is supplied in this source. Part a) remains incomplete, and no sample/bottle assignments are invented. All six listed elements, native reagents, dissolution equations and proof descriptions are literal historical source content.",
